{
  "version": "1",
  "questId": "fr_08",
  "lang": "uk",
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "000fc05",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "З капелюхом ваша голова не мерзне.",
      "sourceEnText": "With a hat, your head won't get cold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_000fc05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:31Z",
      "textHash": "e58e60d0e043adbd7e29c6a6cc6076a2ad9a086c844f0146e78b2e019390886d"
    },
    {
      "key": "001e940",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Дайте відповідь на три запитання про гору.",
      "sourceEnText": "Answer three questions about the mountain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_001e940.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:08Z",
      "textHash": "99705cfea3799af2573add9040ec14bb88031b8f38ae3d005ee97fe83a0ac372"
    },
    {
      "key": "003e87c",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_bonus",
      "sourceText": "Ось тобі гарний теплий шарф! Бери!",
      "sourceEnText": "Here's a nice warm scarf! Take it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003e87c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:33Z",
      "textHash": "b136da428a922fb372f6eee7b9238d84284f1945e450d88c2415cf38f74b57d6"
    },
    {
      "key": "003ecb2",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Монблан — найвища гора у Франції.",
      "sourceEnText": "Mont Blanc is the highest mountain in France.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003ecb2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:38Z",
      "textHash": "5ba5a49388422297876addf3cc21b6479657b0c8e499c18b28af0e86a5b26e67"
    },
    {
      "key": "00a7e83",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Точно!",
      "sourceEnText": "Exact ! ",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_00a7e83.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 940,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:57Z",
      "textHash": "b78121d7f3bdf43ff22d01390819b021101e52e9bd4a540117964a66497b99ce"
    },
    {
      "key": "011dc7e",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Я люблю гори. А ти?",
      "sourceEnText": "I love the mountains. And you?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_011dc7e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:36Z",
      "textHash": "515ea782f4f60c0ef3cc1ff05bb595a0201389c5990607aed367ca9b3f1d2f5b"
    },
    {
      "key": "015bf8a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "Тепер ви готові. Можете підкорити вершину Монблану!",
      "sourceEnText": "Now you're ready. You can go to the summit of Mont Blanc!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_015bf8a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:19Z",
      "textHash": "0de79250cb5d8c54ed36786e6cbba5c0583d5be16c4f17fc4a31402f4f91f0d3"
    },
    {
      "key": "018880a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Вершина Монблану має висоту 4807 метрів.",
      "sourceEnText": "The summit of Mont Blanc is 4807 meters high.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_018880a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4232,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:07Z",
      "textHash": "245865b3de5db0093d7fdbf2d319fe1500b4db6bd45eee5f78a83f269ccc0571"
    },
    {
      "key": "01a4b20",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "пальмове гілля",
      "sourceEnText": "palm fronds",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01a4b20.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:59Z",
      "textHash": "6fba5fe7c45668da3bbe0b3644721db10bb4e0a5fb9d4c13bddfdc1774d15e54"
    },
    {
      "key": "01beb5e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Собака пішов у гори з твоїми речами.",
      "sourceEnText": "The dog went up into the mountains with your things.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01beb5e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:06Z",
      "textHash": "ccb36e93527d2db02fcd800772949611bde6db640afee4958f48cf1e83c80051"
    },
    {
      "key": "01e5f66",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "Ви коли-небудь робили сніговика?",
      "sourceEnText": "Have you ever made a snowman?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01e5f66.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:48Z",
      "textHash": "1360771704ee042b8115d41351259e3bc52208a583f4e8d2b90e4bb81ae9beda"
    },
    {
      "key": "029a03e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "Сонце та сніг болять очі. Тобі потрібні сонцезахисні окуляри.",
      "sourceEnText": "The sun and snow hurt your eyes. You need sunglasses.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029a03e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6243,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:39Z",
      "textHash": "f77196f1d0ae81a746151fc69c6de161a45de465704981f2b1c4cb5e668b68d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "029f39c",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "А тепер вирушайте в гори. Знайдіть теплий одяг та гірське спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "Now go to the mountains. Find warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029f39c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5825,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:18Z",
      "textHash": "4078af3093fb6cd2b8098efbcd4274407b258c2ea9490fe7d33e9657fc93a155"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a2ea9",
      "nodeTitle": "item_sunglasses",
      "sourceText": "У горах сонце та сніг ріжуть очі",
      "sourceEnText": "In the mountains, the sun and snow hurt the eyes",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a2ea9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:50Z",
      "textHash": "1e15928350055fba693ce8d429fd7dbc933376223f21209457aa2a630bbdf702"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a3874",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman_1",
      "sourceText": "Ні, дякую, я залишуся тут.",
      "sourceEnText": "No thanks, I'll stay here.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a3874.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:27Z",
      "textHash": "95a0e87fa4f2a8f2c4c6dac6f9375016a70029fc0bba1c932a0046a9a8c09670"
    },
    {
      "key": "02c9805",
      "nodeTitle": "activity_3_done",
      "sourceText": "Відкрий скриню, щоб дістати кішки!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to get crampons!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02c9805.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:26Z",
      "textHash": "815430719b65ae99e2b767ce69ababaf3afc0f61168e5ebba7bfe389cd0b9e5a"
    },
    {
      "key": "030fa1c",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Молодець! Ви досягли вершини Монблану.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! You've reached the summit of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_030fa1c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3918,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:05Z",
      "textHash": "1e0ea3172031663fe2fe592b975bf63974d54497b8f1249766836e220f193885"
    },
    {
      "key": "035e68a",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовий табір 4",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 4",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_035e68a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:48Z",
      "textHash": "819f7231d15487a5c337d5b278ef8af817404c2e0859eb1b80aa380066f6c42c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0371d31",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_alps_climber",
      "sourceText": "Гірський гід може піти з вами.",
      "sourceEnText": "A mountain guide can come with you.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0371d31.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:53Z",
      "textHash": "febd3f969f3aa28d24a64c4891a1afdce6696723ec092b8fcb7923928192eac1"
    },
    {
      "key": "038d1bc",
      "nodeTitle": "item_rope",
      "sourceText": "Мотузка дозволяє безпечно пересуватися на льоду та скелях.",
      "sourceEnText": "The rope allows you to be safe on ice and rocks.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_038d1bc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4336,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:03Z",
      "textHash": "a261f55fdb2fed965b0ee738735209aea6568f108a8170649a81bd8494447212"
    },
    {
      "key": "03db010",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Швейцарія розташована на північ від Монблану.",
      "sourceEnText": "Switzerland is north of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03db010.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4571,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:42:28Z",
      "textHash": "c7639b719dbfc658ed40502e41734c6ad31031c4176ba1c9eaf8bbb9045dd1b3"
    },
    {
      "key": "03dd802",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "У тебе немає пальта. Іди знайди його!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have a coat. Go find it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03dd802.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:22Z",
      "textHash": "fb1ca6e5f004f2efd6d67eaf685fb88c894374d48a5612dd06b697b6fe6d0d4f"
    },
    {
      "key": "045409f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "По-перше, вам знадобиться рюкзак.",
      "sourceEnText": "First, you need a backpack.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_045409f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:10Z",
      "textHash": "6f9397a62b6999cc77463443e509edbaedadd3c2c6b23b67d0ad48654df01a07"
    },
    {
      "key": "046eb33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Повернися, коли знайдеш.",
      "sourceEnText": "Come back when you've found it.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_046eb33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:03Z",
      "textHash": "c60018a95bdf646eb5102649b5b6aed86d2c3207816626809035f40c781466aa"
    },
    {
      "key": "04bbada",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Придивись уважніше! Ти побачиш бабака.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look closely! You're going to see a marmot.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04bbada.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:39Z",
      "textHash": "33bad0d9d18617ade818ea08e8f610c1544b51b5b1701289dbe0397f3b9e9b24"
    },
    {
      "key": "04c1c1f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "У тебе є рюкзак. А тепер іди бери теплий одяг та гірське спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your backpack. Now go get your warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04c1c1f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5538,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:59Z",
      "textHash": "4487f2204f8b22ea3f70e6d09a3948f0ecb88f89f8b39ded0e13a528d45cb751"
    },
    {
      "key": "050fe70",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_italy",
      "sourceText": "Італія розташована на схід від Монблану.",
      "sourceEnText": "Italy is east of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_050fe70.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2978,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:42:27Z",
      "textHash": "90e2958172c766c321f67eb5ad8d3f448eaff97bd2185c2659e0550e6cf30ebf"
    },
    {
      "key": "0557ef5",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "У горах лежить сніг.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is snow in the mountains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0557ef5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:45Z",
      "textHash": "8922f1292440d881e286b4cfb5d04d56ba36c1608dc89308dbff28317163eced"
    },
    {
      "key": "056ec2b",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_base1",
      "sourceText": "Скриня відкривається! У ній є деяке спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest opens! It contains some equipment.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_056ec2b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3971,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:28Z",
      "textHash": "daf69dfbc1f230dd9cbdd4f1d65345ec7adb4e441acdb82a9f20ace490aa549d"
    },
    {
      "key": "058bb65",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовий табір 3",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 3",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_058bb65.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:47Z",
      "textHash": "79a6fe7f1328c46bccd7c992df5b06e6b127171a5d5e328a68ee0ab51d2cfde6"
    },
    {
      "key": "0590129",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Щоб піднятися на вершину Монблану, візьміть теплий одяг.",
      "sourceEnText": "To go to the summit of Mont Blanc, take warm clothes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0590129.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:41Z",
      "textHash": "d918c9181c2b2ecbd526ea8c6c99ec89d70a84e7f518971bc72b06744ea799a5"
    },
    {
      "key": "059d744",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "Шапка захищає вас від вітру.",
      "sourceEnText": "The hat protects you from the wind.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_059d744.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:33Z",
      "textHash": "61a65cfcff65a71288a8104ebd204714d17911755d4504ed634f2217621ac4f0"
    },
    {
      "key": "05cabb5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Відкрий скриню, щоб знайти рюкзак!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to find the backpack!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05cabb5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:11Z",
      "textHash": "324c94e3e2e8c36903d550caa3e9545cd69aebc835e7ef7d940a43a7d5c7d0e0"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e3658",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовий табір 2",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 2",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e3658.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:47Z",
      "textHash": "de4476ee0165249614541761f3e53d93440d490b5853bae536d99a49232eb59a"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e80cb",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "У рюкзаку є вода, їжа та карта.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the backpack, there is water, food, and a map.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e80cb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:16Z",
      "textHash": "d23582c3559488b9e4b3122e6db901f6c652e0d6858f5ed5c70361227259c5d9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0650acc",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Знайдіть теплий одяг та гірське спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find warm clothing and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0650acc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:08Z",
      "textHash": "55632cdc69c5dfc61e29e43dc4d635903490b077e208893ee67c232305286c81"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b15bb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "У вас є гірське спорядження. Остання спроба досягти вершини.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your mountain gear. One last effort to reach the summit.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b15bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4702,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:53Z",
      "textHash": "3fabcbb198ebd2fd0d9405e0373d3cd1c09fbe8f8ef37681e423b172c8164673"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b3363",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "У тебе ж немає рукавичок!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have any gloves!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b3363.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:37Z",
      "textHash": "5914045e240ae7c28b60cfe91b74ea48172b4201780b29a0aafc272deb21c794"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d9f34",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Щоб ходити по льодовиковому льоду, нам потрібне спеціальне спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "To walk on glacier ice, we need special gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06d9f34.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4937,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:21Z",
      "textHash": "12fb2fbdd5ed91848efd3d5cae5aaf8462e633d4c23380adec0c6e5be09c3de9"
    },
    {
      "key": "06f9a2a",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "У якому гірському хребті розташований Монблан?",
      "sourceEnText": "In which mountain range is Mont Blanc located?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06f9a2a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3605,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:10Z",
      "textHash": "e653b7ffbbcc3ccef6df09a2bcfdc15d051e3dd69f650e0b042ff71a76fa30c0"
    },
    {
      "key": "07102e7",
      "nodeTitle": "item_crampons",
      "sourceText": "Кішки допомагають ходити по льоду.",
      "sourceEnText": "Crampons help you walk on ice.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_07102e7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:02Z",
      "textHash": "efd33ecb4b2085ad3b9e3065d5c7f666f515ca1841174f7d8a042adcca336698"
    },
    {
      "key": "0724de3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Допоможіть мені! Я ваш гірський гід. Синій собака забрав ваші речі.",
      "sourceEnText": "Help me! I'm your mountain guide. A blue dog took your things.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0724de3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6478,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:05Z",
      "textHash": "8b352965d4b9a7eaa1c8bfd97db828712e12183f76bc278f347cc3b18caf6004"
    },
    {
      "key": "076433f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Що одягати на взуття, щоб ходити по льоду?",
      "sourceEnText": "What do you put on your shoes to walk on ice?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_076433f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:56Z",
      "textHash": "b0176415f3f4fcf0a9e8b1451be9efeb506494f4a9fe3d9311fc140c145c5929"
    },
    {
      "key": "07c6385",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Ні! Ти не біля басейну! Спробуй ще раз.",
      "sourceEnText": "No! You're not at the swimming pool! Try again.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_07c6385.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2952,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:00Z",
      "textHash": "c120f7dcc28e157e09d77013c37ea9f6fc971b153a2d8da1a72c3058906a5a47"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f2635",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовий табір 1",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 1",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_07f2635.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:46Z",
      "textHash": "2930cf76a87da03492c770211d9a3a35051ce17426feb5dda32cd78c6f3f754b"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f2699",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Знайдіть теплий одяг та гірське спорядження.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_07f2699.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3683,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:02Z",
      "textHash": "55632cdc69c5dfc61e29e43dc4d635903490b077e208893ee67c232305286c81"
    },
    {
      "key": "0809dce",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_alps_climber",
      "sourceText": "Монблан — дуже красива гора.",
      "sourceEnText": "Mont Blanc is a very beautiful mountain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0809dce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:50Z",
      "textHash": "99545c816b6765938a87db157bd9dfc680eb55033699aff18969b10ca13629dd"
    },
    {
      "key": "081fbe4",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_alps_climber",
      "sourceText": "Хочеш поїхати в гори?",
      "sourceEnText": "Do you want to go to the mountains?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_081fbe4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:51Z",
      "textHash": "8d46a4aa225edf4bbbc4848ab935c4a11c8499a2eccf494618d7146b63025bcc"
    },
    {
      "key": "088fb7f",
      "nodeTitle": "item_sunglasses",
      "sourceText": "Сонячні окуляри захищають очі.",
      "sourceEnText": "Sunglasses protect the eyes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_088fb7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:51Z",
      "textHash": "6ad0fe19e2e358331aa756050286c514268293baa42bcad26c8791caa52e8e2c"
    },
    {
      "key": "097ecf0",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Увага! Гора небезпечна.",
      "sourceEnText": "Warning! The mountain is dangerous.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_097ecf0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:42Z",
      "textHash": "c1b424bfee3fa8b1ba2c969e319d2287826fbc395403780185ce6ab6daa64022"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a70f7d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "Що захищає очі?",
      "sourceEnText": "What protects the eyes?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0a70f7d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:40Z",
      "textHash": "667ed87dff0deeb7e96951610a6db47d27191e97499e6fa0a512940e4cf3e5fd"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a7146f",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "Продовжуйте лазити!",
      "sourceEnText": "Keep climbing!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0a7146f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:34Z",
      "textHash": "b3c3d2373986313f75b437f998eeb791aab3204d35eb02d8a1bf0a2d34f68624"
    },
    {
      "key": "0afb2dc",
      "nodeTitle": "item_scarf",
      "sourceText": "З шарфом ваша шия не мерзне.",
      "sourceEnText": "With a scarf, your neck won't get cold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0afb2dc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:34Z",
      "textHash": "cc25dc1b3d4d1fad5b54c5593a49d6d7b39e87826fd58efa8d2acce8a95122c9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b50050",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Крампони",
      "sourceEnText": "Crampons",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0b50050.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1097,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:41:23Z",
      "textHash": "f2ddf387e3325a46f569b7f01a73deabc8207d1f10542ce99907d628059499b3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bc67f7",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "Придивіться уважніше! Ви побачите козла.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look closely! You're going to see an ibex.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0bc67f7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3631,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:47Z",
      "textHash": "6534428c948f3ab994ddb8e0e161f72fbce4a4699896cc4ef1e7d3617b0c7d38"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c18060",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman_1",
      "sourceText": "Тобі потрібна допомога?",
      "sourceEnText": "Do you need help getting on?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0c18060.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:24Z",
      "textHash": "da8c3439396ca754a23ec7e0047441b278aa26f1392cb0a410032d36172f3e70"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c18c08",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "У тебе немає мотузки!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have a rope!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0c18c08.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:54Z",
      "textHash": "f816b034f1cb231e66cf6a00ee9a81ead02df3d93bdfedd7d4da761fb9b1b8cc"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c1f006",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_intro",
      "sourceText": "Скриня відкривається! Бери рюкзак.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest opens! Take the backpack.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0c1f006.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:13Z",
      "textHash": "9ec3d143c2839c8546ce04702ab132a25c5f36699759053a09ab2a31beaae76d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d01879",
      "nodeTitle": "item_gloves",
      "sourceText": "У горах холодно",
      "sourceEnText": "It's cold in the mountains",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0d01879.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:48Z",
      "textHash": "b4851a4c275368c0a15a10173abde7aa3357ee88e29f7574a416077620fd79d8"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d23529",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_france",
      "sourceText": "Франція знаходиться на захід від Монблану.",
      "sourceEnText": "France is west of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0d23529.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:42:27Z",
      "textHash": "12fc97c0fbdf381bf94b4d665b446dca6d2a9df1c653bd6105eb2d3805fda9cc"
    },
    {
      "key": "0dbac73",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "Щоб піти в гори, візьміть гарне взуття.",
      "sourceEnText": "To go into the mountains, take good shoes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0dbac73.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:44Z",
      "textHash": "0bcf223313c5d33cf5359ee3db7d22ce1698274980a061020d991f0fc1fab932"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e23f1f",
      "nodeTitle": "item_coat",
      "sourceText": "У пальто ви зігрієтесь, коли вітряно чи йде сніг.",
      "sourceEnText": "With a coat, you stay warm when it's windy or snowy.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0e23f1f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3683,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:30Z",
      "textHash": "df32fb5438b3bfb5171d20da2f9d8d16e6e10e89d1be84967180923b20ad9700"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e83480",
      "nodeTitle": "activity_1_done",
      "sourceText": "Відкрий скриню, щоб знайти капелюх!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to find the hat!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0e83480.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:27Z",
      "textHash": "388bdec08a7b86253f4ef1f00b34fe1703dfe4f35a8debe4851a6d2d1b8d6f48"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f2aac7",
      "nodeTitle": "item_gloves",
      "sourceText": "Рукавички захищають руки.",
      "sourceEnText": "The gloves protect the hands.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0f2aac7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:46Z",
      "textHash": "02f5e978c3dc83c04a0a0f3523e89bbfdaf22a5f5b5efb4eb402879f05c8bfee"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f4644b",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Підніміться на вершину Монблану",
      "sourceEnText": "Climb to the top of Mont Blanc",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0f4644b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:00Z",
      "textHash": "2a8a58de5561e91ebda5bad3e663766bd7436948f3844916b71fb609050f5c87"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f4c405",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman_1",
      "sourceText": "Так, будь ласка, допоможіть мені.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, please help me.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0f4c405.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:25Z",
      "textHash": "d99d334b026420ef0ea888fe89cf36d4e2afa3e6a998a4727bda36bbeccd233e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0fdc3cb",
      "nodeTitle": "activity_2_done",
      "sourceText": "Відкрий багажник, щоб знайти сонцезахисні окуляри!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the trunk to find the sunglasses!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0fdc3cb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:43Z",
      "textHash": "47fd696f117d1cfe233a269d1d0cd83cb2ced1b67e89fe9280e094b8d88638a3"
    },
    {
      "key": "b1_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "Вітряно. Треба захищати вуха.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's windy. You need to protect your ears.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_b1_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:24Z",
      "textHash": "5195633627060637b1ea7f402da79ca9708b26e40a79cc3d1be21fd2b1258c18"
    },
    {
      "key": "b1_q",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "Як захистити свої вуха?",
      "sourceEnText": "How to protect your ears?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_b1_q.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:25Z",
      "textHash": "f9d67a06bf845b3b9e09e5673c844f156d98bd2f08f667f55280a49b08f87482"
    },
    {
      "key": "chest_locked",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_intro",
      "sourceText": "Скриня замкнена. Знайдіть ключ, щоб її відкрити.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest is locked. Find the key to open it.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_chest_locked.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3971,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:14Z",
      "textHash": "898d8a88ad5f2abe6ea8167e2c8eaab7a2d1028b6a83c3eb324c02e9dc8b8967"
    },
    {
      "key": "comebacklater",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "Повертайся пізніше!",
      "sourceEnText": "Come back later!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_comebacklater.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T18:59:06Z",
      "textHash": "2e76eb8d2429b78ff34998ed321d74109dc99fa11d8eb7fcac3a8c14ac95b74c"
    },
    {
      "key": "correct",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "Саме так.",
      "sourceEnText": "That's right.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_correct.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1045,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:13Z",
      "textHash": "2af303154ae1c52ce5f9652fc3e0f15f5f95cb760055a9bc015eab91e3f9dce7"
    },
    {
      "key": "dontknow",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "Я не знаю",
      "sourceEnText": "I don't know",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_dontknow.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 993,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T18:59:06Z",
      "textHash": "ef74e6f6b807789e4d654b5ef26ab477466adfb2225141d4946753d58fb88cf6"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_1",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Молодець! Ви досягли вершини Монблану. Його висота становить 4807 метрів. Це найвища гора Франції.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! You've reached the summit of Mont Blanc. It measures 4807 meters. It's the highest mountain in France.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_end_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 9221,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:54Z",
      "textHash": "7f6eb6131666469147b12139fa0c7e1d9bd4163ccf2645ed39bd89bd926b9f5f"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_2",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "В Альпах є багато великих і красивих гір.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the Alps, there are many large and beautiful mountains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_end_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3736,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:55Z",
      "textHash": "3ce83cf1dea04e1efe0ce3f680f2820666f73ce6435288b788c2019d6744c1a1"
    },
    {
      "key": "fr08_b2_chest",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_base2",
      "sourceText": "Багажник відкритий! Дістаньте сонцезахисні окуляри.",
      "sourceEnText": "The trunk is open! Take out the sunglasses.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_b2_chest.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4624,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:45Z",
      "textHash": "79c6e83b8ba1be2ef8d02f95fada2248d6794010cc53dda517d99bde12c18223"
    },
    {
      "key": "fr08_b2_help",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "Сніговик може тобі допомогти.",
      "sourceEnText": "The snowman can help you.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_b2_help.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:05:36Z",
      "textHash": "fc7bc603bbc95b959df6d8b39233397dde478a0e0ead9f875847e243532fb72e"
    },
    {
      "key": "fr08_marmot_2",
      "nodeTitle": "marmot",
      "sourceText": "Я сплю всю зиму, кажуть, що впадаю в сплячку.",
      "sourceEnText": "I sleep all winter, they say I hibernate.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_marmot_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:06:28Z",
      "textHash": "65a052dee3fad58c8cb7b3160343a368f8ad3cd523fcee46bdb74dc109d634e4"
    },
    {
      "key": "fr08_marmot_3",
      "nodeTitle": "marmot",
      "sourceText": "Я люблю їсти квіти, фрукти та трави. Ням!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love eating flowers, fruits, and herbs. Yum!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_fr08_marmot_3.mp3",
